{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes from Ciudadela is a first-person adventure and puzzle-solving game focused on exploration, environmental storytelling, and narrative discovery. You play as Katari, who follows the trail of his recently dead father after uncovering his journal, that leads him to a sealed mountain known as Ciudadela.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, your main artifact is a Balearic sling, a tool tied to both the environment and the forgotten technologies hidden within the mountain. As you dive deeper and solve puzzles, you\u2019ll unlock journal entries left behind by Katari\u2019s father. Each revealing pieces of a lost civilization and their connection to time, invention, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/5eb345518225ae5be24a776a6e80a961.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles of Past, Present &amp; Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles inspired by historic inventions.</strong> Observe, experiment, and connect old machines to progress and be rewarded for your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/a23a4b7e64229e61daf7218fea10f9b9.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/a23a4b7e64229e61daf7218fea10f9b9.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/a23a4b7e64229e61daf7218fea10f9b9.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tool With History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Balearic sling</strong> is both weapon and utility. Aim, charge, and release to <strong>hit distant targets</strong>, <strong>break brittle seals</strong>\u00a0and <strong>ricochet shots</strong> around corners.\u00a0As you progress, <strong>upgrades broaden its uses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/56e570e8cc7b4d8fe523e708f11ff1b1.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/56e570e8cc7b4d8fe523e708f11ff1b1.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/56e570e8cc7b4d8fe523e708f11ff1b1.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Personal Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Katari was supposed to spread his distant father ashes on the top of Ciudadela as his dying wish. But his main objective may be interrupted by curiosity after he finds his father logs about Ciudadela and the echoes beneath it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/16b5157b7f48c30be62e56d73500d9cf.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/16b5157b7f48c30be62e56d73500d9cf.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/16b5157b7f48c30be62e56d73500d9cf.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the Echoes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ciudadela has been asleep for centuries, filled with artifacts and technology that came before and<strong> after.\u00a0</strong>\u00a0Discover ancient relics, awake forgotten weapons and learn about a civilization that evolves faster than\u00a0<strong>time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/3269830e1e1a9df0eff9cb42e0d92932.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/3269830e1e1a9df0eff9cb42e0d92932.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/3269830e1e1a9df0eff9cb42e0d92932.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person narrative adventure</strong> focused on exploration, environmental interaction, and readable physical puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking</strong> Patagonian vistas and sci-fi intervened caverns to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional voice acting</strong> carries\u00a0Katari\u2019s journey and key discoveries. Clean delivery and natural pacing keep the story clear and accessible.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story you uncover</strong>: piece together Katari's father field logs and choose how deeply to dig into the lore behind Ciudadela.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pristine Sound Design:</strong> Spatialized audio, responsive layers, and meticulous foley bring Ciudadela to life. Subtle mechanical cues and environmental ambiences double as readable hints without breaking immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019790?t=1767536365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/6a55bbac79a8c6e7dd31f21d04e384c35efc9569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767536365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/e2867cc32ed61a1ce30edb159ff354c144025ad4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767536365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/e2867cc32ed61a1ce30edb159ff354c144025ad4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767536365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes from Ciudadela is a first-person adventure and puzzle-solving game focused on exploration, environmental storytelling, and narrative discovery. You play as Katari, who follows the trail of his recently dead father after uncovering his journal, that leads him to a sealed mountain known as Ciudadela.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, your main artifact is a Balearic sling, a tool tied to both the environment and the forgotten technologies hidden within the mountain. As you dive deeper and solve puzzles, you\u2019ll unlock journal entries left behind by Katari\u2019s father. Each revealing pieces of a lost civilization and their connection to time, invention, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/5eb345518225ae5be24a776a6e80a961.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles of Past, Present &amp; Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles inspired by historic inventions.</strong> Observe, experiment, and connect old machines to progress and be rewarded for your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/a23a4b7e64229e61daf7218fea10f9b9.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/a23a4b7e64229e61daf7218fea10f9b9.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/a23a4b7e64229e61daf7218fea10f9b9.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tool With History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Balearic sling</strong> is both weapon and utility. Aim, charge, and release to <strong>hit distant targets</strong>, <strong>break brittle seals</strong>\u00a0and <strong>ricochet shots</strong> around corners.\u00a0As you progress, <strong>upgrades broaden its uses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/56e570e8cc7b4d8fe523e708f11ff1b1.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/56e570e8cc7b4d8fe523e708f11ff1b1.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/56e570e8cc7b4d8fe523e708f11ff1b1.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Personal Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Katari was supposed to spread his distant father ashes on the top of Ciudadela as his dying wish. But his main objective may be interrupted by curiosity after he finds his father logs about Ciudadela and the echoes beneath it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/16b5157b7f48c30be62e56d73500d9cf.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/16b5157b7f48c30be62e56d73500d9cf.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/16b5157b7f48c30be62e56d73500d9cf.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the Echoes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ciudadela has been asleep for centuries, filled with artifacts and technology that came before and<strong> after.\u00a0</strong>\u00a0Discover ancient relics, awake forgotten weapons and learn about a civilization that evolves faster than\u00a0<strong>time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/3269830e1e1a9df0eff9cb42e0d92932.poster.avif?t=1767536365\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/3269830e1e1a9df0eff9cb42e0d92932.webm?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/extras/3269830e1e1a9df0eff9cb42e0d92932.mp4?t=1767536365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person narrative adventure</strong> focused on exploration, environmental interaction, and readable physical puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking</strong> Patagonian vistas and sci-fi intervened caverns to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional voice acting</strong> carries\u00a0Katari\u2019s journey and key discoveries. Clean delivery and natural pacing keep the story clear and accessible.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story you uncover</strong>: piece together Katari's father field logs and choose how deeply to dig into the lore behind Ciudadela.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pristine Sound Design:</strong> Spatialized audio, responsive layers, and meticulous foley bring Ciudadela to life. Subtle mechanical cues and environmental ambiences double as readable hints without breaking immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kronos Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019790/8a2bef9e9f2c22df98cc84d82fdd434f6842fc45/header.jpg?t=1767536365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4019790/1216911533/1f445a2faee0645e7ec2cb98ad181a863874fb5b/1767535264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767536363","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4019790/1216911533/1f445a2faee0645e7ec2cb98ad181a863874fb5b/1767535264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767536363","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4019790/1216911533/1f445a2faee0645e7ec2cb98ad181a863874fb5b/1767535264/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767536363","id":257259142,"name":"Echoes From Ciudadela Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259142/efb089bd8afc4d615f4d77623a1f3ccf459d0209/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767536363"}],"name":"Echoes From Ciudadela","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</st